# Netlify redirects: send the Netlify address and www to one canonical domain.
#
# These rules are switched off (commented out) until the domain is ready, so nothing breaks before then:
# 1. Add your domain to the site in Netlify's domain settings first. Netlify then sets up HTTPS for it automatically.
# 2. Replace [DOMAIN] below with that domain (e.g. example.co.uk).
# 3. Remove the "# " at the start of the two rules and redeploy.
#
# https://blacklinehq.netlify.app/*  https://[DOMAIN]/:splat  301!
# https://www.[DOMAIN]/*             https://[DOMAIN]/:splat  301!
